---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<Page title="about">
  <h1>about</h1>
  <p class="sub label">free and open source</p>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      bambi is an ambisonics plugin suite: plugins that share a core, a look, a modulation matrix and a link
      between instances. It works in AmbiX (ACN ordering, SN3D normalisation) at
      any order the host carries.
    </p>
    <p>
      bambi's own code is GPL-3.0-or-later; plugin builds, which include JUCE, are distributed under AGPLv3.
      The source is on <a href="https://github.com/Looderso/bambi">GitHub</a>, and every release carries its
      complete source and the notices of the third-party components it contains.
    </p>
  </div>

  <section class="thanks">
    <h2>thanks</h2>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>The people who inspired bambi and helped make it. The research and software it builds on are credited on <a href={`${base}/research/foundations`}>foundations</a>.</p>
      <p class="fine">This list is being written.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="prose notices">
    <p class="fine">VST is a registered trademark of Steinberg Media Technologies GmbH.
    </p>
  </div>
</Page>

<style>
  .sub {
    margin: 12px 0 var(--section);
  }
  .thanks,
  .notices {
    margin-top: var(--section);
  }
</style>
